 Identity&lt;br&gt;mỗi pod một quyền" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#DD344C;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.identity_and_access_management;" vertex="1" parent="shared"><mxGeometry x="744" y="72" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Đề xuất · chưa duyệt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• KVS không có VPC endpoint dùng được (phải xin AWS,&lt;br&gt;tối đa 10 stream) → Lambda ngoài VPC lấy khung,&lt;br&gt;cụm EKS không cần NAT&lt;br&gt;• Chỉ xoá message SQS sau khi đã ghi sự kiện;&lt;br&gt;lỗi 3 lần → DLQ&lt;br&gt;• Mã sự kiện = camera + thời điểm → chạy lại không trùng&lt;br&gt;• g6.xlarge đủ VRAM cho cả hai model: chưa đo tải thật&lt;br&gt;• S1 ~42 s/khung vẫn là nút thắt chi phí" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fbe7d4,#3a2a16);strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="region"><mxGeometry x="1532" y="1176" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sink" value="&lt;b&gt;SANG TẦNG 3–4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Firehose · Lambda&lt;br&gt;→ S3 Tables · DynamoDB" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#eaf3ff,#10202e);strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2810" y="799" width="190" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="__title" value="milk-camera — Tầng 2 Xử lý: chi tiết compute (bản demo 23/09, chưa duyệt)" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E8E8E8);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="24" width="3050" height="30" as="geom